{"id":802441,"title":"课程介绍","content":"RAG（Retrieval-Augmented Generation）是一种结合了信息检索和语言模型的技术，旨在解决大模型生成内容时的准确性问题。2020年，Facebook AI FAIR团队首次提出RAG概念，通过从大量文档中检索相关信息来指导文本生成，从而提高预测质量。RAG的基本流程包括将文档切分、嵌入向量、相似度计算、排序并选取相关文档片段，最后将这些片段与问题拼接成一个prompt，输入大模型生成答案。\n\n相比微调，RAG具有多方面优势：能够利用外部知识库，及时更新数据，回复具有可解释性，对数据量要求较低，减少幻觉产生，并且在安全和隐私管理上更具可控性。RAG适用于动态数据环境，无需频繁重新训练，适合资源有限的情况。此外，RAG可以整合结构化知识库如MySQL或Neo4j，提高复杂查询处理能力。\n\n随着技术发展，RAG逐渐演变为KG-RAG或GraphRAG，通过融合知识图谱进一步提升模型性能。本课程旨在帮助学习者熟悉RAG基本流程及其优化策略，并了解KG-RAG的具体实践思路。课程内容涵盖LangChain框架下的RAG入门与优化、KG-RAG实现思路及微软GraphRAG方案解析等，旨在为学员构建全面的RAG知识体系。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":393615,"user_name":"苏果果","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2852467,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"12A62ED032F345","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/2b/86/73/5190bbde.jpg","comment_is_top":true,"comment_ctime":1724323197,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":3,"race_medal":1,"score":2,"product_id":100799801,"comment_content":"各位同学好，课程不提供PPT资料，特此声明～","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1123913,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/26/49/b7b1d8e2.jpg","nickname":"爱学习的小超超","note":"","ucode":"2757B4FBA46323","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":650860,"discussion_content":"为啥不提供啊","content_length":6,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1725777390,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":1,"child_discussions":[{"author":{"id":2852467,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/2b/86/73/5190bbde.jpg","nickname":"苏果果","note":"","ucode":"12A62ED032F345","race_medal":1,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":1123913,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/